<title>MEXICO: Soriana Q2 earnings per share rises.</title>
<headline>Soriana Q2 earnings per share rises.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican retailer Organizacion Soriana said its earnings per share during the second quarter were 0.30 peso versus 0.24 peso during the same period of the year before.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said its second quarter sales were 2.549 billion pesos during the quarter compared to 2.206 billion during the year-ago quarter.</p>
